    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claw your way to glory in this fast-paced 2D platformer-shooter adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a fearless feline on a mission through <strong>five action-packed worlds</strong>, each teeming with enemies, hazards, and hidden treasures. Jump, slide, and blast your way through vibrant retro-style levels, collecting <strong>coins and rare gems</strong> to upgrade your abilities and become more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With tight controls, challenging platforming, and explosive combat, every level is a test of skill and reflexes. Upgrade your cat's powers\u2014from a basic pistol to a fully automatic weapon, double jumps and bubble shield \u2014 as you prepare to face off against world bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual cat lover or a hardcore arcade veteran, this game delivers the perfect mix of challenge, charm, and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think you're done? Think again.</strong> Beat all five worlds and unlock a hidden vault of <strong>bonus levels and arcade-style minigames</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your reflexes and rack up high scores in quirky side challenges like <strong>Coconut Catch</strong>, where timing is everything, or <strong>Ice Climb</strong>, a vertical sprint through slippery chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame offers a fresh twist on the core mechanics, with online leaderboards so you can <strong>compete with friends and claw your way to the top</strong>. These bite-sized challenges are the perfect way to test your skills and keep the fun going long after the final boss is defeated.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claw your way to glory in this fast-paced 2D platformer-shooter adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a fearless feline on a mission through <strong>five action-packed worlds</strong>, each teeming with enemies, hazards, and hidden treasures. Jump, slide, and blast your way through vibrant retro-style levels, collecting <strong>coins and rare gems</strong> to upgrade your abilities and become more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With tight controls, challenging platforming, and explosive combat, every level is a test of skill and reflexes. Upgrade your cat's powers\u2014from a basic pistol to a fully automatic weapon, double jumps and bubble shield \u2014 as you prepare to face off against world bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual cat lover or a hardcore arcade veteran, this game delivers the perfect mix of challenge, charm, and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think you're done? Think again.</strong> Beat all five worlds and unlock a hidden vault of <strong>bonus levels and arcade-style minigames</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your reflexes and rack up high scores in quirky side challenges like <strong>Coconut Catch</strong>, where timing is everything, or <strong>Ice Climb</strong>, a vertical sprint through slippery chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame offers a fresh twist on the core mechanics, with online leaderboards so you can <strong>compete with friends and claw your way to the top</strong>. These bite-sized challenges are the perfect way to test your skills and keep the fun going long after the final boss is defeated.</p>",
    "short_description": "Claw your way through 5 action-packed worlds in this fast-paced 2D platformer-shooter! Upgrade your feline hero, battle bosses, and unlock minigames like Coconut Catch and Ice Climb. Master every level and top the leaderboards!",
